{"id":"vd-a2-the-little-flower-shop","level":"a2","n":28,"title":{"en":"How About a Workshop?","vi":"Hay là mở lớp hướng dẫn?"},"summary":"Bên tách trà, Lena đưa ra từng ý tưởng cứu tiệm hoa của bà Ines khỏi siêu thị mới — bà thì chưa tin lắm.","source":{"type":"story","id":"st-a2-the-little-flower-shop","level":"a2","title":{"en":"The Little Flower Shop","vi":"Tiệm hoa nhỏ"}},"scene":{"background":"cafe","props":[{"id":"flowers","x":800},{"id":"tea","x":980}]},"cast":{"lena":{"name":{"en":"Lena","vi":"Lena"},"look":"woman","x":520,"style":{"hair":"ponytail","hairColor":"#3A2A22","skin":"#D9A27A","skinShade":"#C48A62","outfit":"jacket","top":"#5DBB63","topShade":"#4AA350"}},"ines":{"name":{"en":"Ines","vi":"Bà Ines"},"look":"grandma","x":1130,"style":{"outfit":"apron","skin":"#D9A27A","skinShade":"#C48A62","hairColor":"#C9C6CF","top":"#E07B5F","topShade":"#C8654B"}}},"lines":[{"speaker":"ines","en":"I'm sorry, Lena. I think it's time to close the shop.","vi":"Bà xin lỗi, Lena. Bà nghĩ đã đến lúc đóng cửa tiệm rồi.","ipa":["aɪm","ˈsɑɹi","ˈlinə","aɪ","θɪŋk","ɪts","taɪm","tu","kloʊz","ðə","ʃɑp"],"start":0.554,"end":4.864,"expression":"sad","timing":[[0,0.554],[1,0.696],[2,1.432],[3,2.896],[4,3.104],[5,3.326],[6,3.507],[7,3.785],[8,3.896],[9,4.271],[10,4.368]]},{"speaker":"lena","en":"Close? No! We can't win on price.","vi":"Đóng cửa á? Không! Mình không thắng được về giá.","ipa":["kloʊz","noʊ","wi","kænt","wɪn","ɑn","pɹaɪs"],"start":5.654,"end":8.524,"expression":"surprised","timing":[[0,5.654],[1,6.45],[2,7.345],[3,7.541],[4,7.773],[5,7.896],[6,8.055]]},{"speaker":"lena","en":"But we can offer something different.","vi":"Nhưng mình có thể mang đến điều khác biệt.","ipa":["bʌt","wi","kæn","ˈɔfɚ","ˈsʌmθɪŋ","ˈdɪfɚənt"],"start":9.064,"end":10.854,"expression":"thinking","timing":[[0,9.064],[1,9.407],[2,9.542],[3,9.677],[4,9.996],[5,10.388]]},{"speaker":"ines","en":"Like what?","vi":"Như thế nào?","ipa":["laɪk","wʌt"],"start":11.644,"end":12.244,"expression":"confused","timing":[[0,11.644],[1,11.865]]},{"speaker":"lena","en":"Your knowledge, Grandma. You know everything about flowers.","vi":"Kiến thức của bà đấy ạ. Bà biết mọi thứ về hoa mà.","ipa":["jɔɹ","ˈnɑlədʒ","ˈɡɹændmɑ","ju","noʊ","ˈɛvɹiˌθɪŋ","əˈbaʊt","ˈflaʊɚz"],"start":13.034,"end":16.474,"gesture":"explain","prop":"flowers","timing":[[0,13.034],[1,13.145],[2,13.868],[3,14.712],[4,14.921],[5,15.178],[6,15.644],[7,15.864]]},{"speaker":"lena","en":"How about a weekend workshop? You could teach people to make bouquets.","vi":"Hay là mở lớp hướng dẫn cuối tuần? Bà có thể dạy mọi người bó hoa.","ipa":["haʊ","əˈbaʊt","ə","ˈwiˌkɛnd","ˈwɝkˌʃɑp","ju","kʊd","titʃ","ˈpipəl","tu","meɪk","boʊˈkeɪz"],"start":17.014,"end":20.454,"expression":"happy","timing":[[0,17.014],[1,17.112],[2,17.333],[3,17.406],[4,17.75],[5,18.631],[6,18.839],[7,18.986],[8,19.231],[9,19.562],[10,19.648],[11,19.856]]},{"speaker":"ines","en":"A workshop? I'm not sure. I'm not a teacher.","vi":"Lớp hướng dẫn á? Bà không chắc. Bà có phải giáo viên đâu.","ipa":["ə","ˈwɝkˌʃɑp","aɪm","nɑt","ʃʊɹ","aɪm","nɑt","ə","ˈtitʃɚ"],"start":21.244,"end":25.944,"expression":"worried","timing":[[0,21.244],[1,21.295],[2,22.967],[3,23.189],[4,23.411],[5,24.911],[6,25.133],[7,25.342],[8,25.411]]},{"speaker":"lena","en":"But you talk to customers every day. That's teaching!","vi":"Nhưng ngày nào bà cũng nói chuyện với khách. Thế là dạy rồi còn gì!","ipa":["bʌt","ju","tɔk","tu","ˈkʌstəmɚz","ˈɛvɚi","deɪ","ðæts","ˈtitʃɪŋ"],"start":26.734,"end":29.934,"expression":"happy","timing":[[0,26.734],[1,26.894],[2,26.992],[3,27.274],[4,27.372],[5,28.021],[6,28.278],[7,29.025],[8,29.368]]},{"speaker":"ines","en":"Hmm. That's a good idea, but who will come?","vi":"Ừm. Ý hay đấy, nhưng ai sẽ đến chứ?","ipa":["hm","ðæts","ə","ɡʊd","aɪˈdiə","bʌt","hu","wɪl","kʌm"],"start":30.724,"end":34.344,"expression":"thinking","timing":[[0,30.724],[1,32.228],[2,32.506],[3,32.59],[4,32.784],[5,33.465],[6,33.617],[7,33.784],[8,33.937]]},{"speaker":"lena","en":"What if we put photos of your flowers online every day?","vi":"Nếu mình đăng ảnh hoa của bà lên mạng mỗi ngày thì sao ạ?","ipa":["wʌt","ɪf","wi","pʊt","ˈfoʊˌtoʊz","ʌv","jɔɹ","ˈflaʊɚz","ˈɔnˌlaɪn","ˈɛvɚi","deɪ"],"start":35.134,"end":37.794,"gesture":"explain","timing":[[0,35.134],[1,35.267],[2,35.353],[3,35.487],[4,35.671],[5,36.027],[6,36.088],[7,36.235],[8,36.676],[9,37.13],[10,37.362]]},{"speaker":"ines","en":"Online? At my age?","vi":"Lên mạng á? Ở tuổi bà á?","ipa":["ˈɔnˌlaɪn","æt","maɪ","eɪdʒ"],"start":38.584,"end":41.024,"expression":"surprised","timing":[[0,38.584],[1,40.122],[2,40.303],[3,40.511]]},{"speaker":"lena","en":"I'll do that part. And we could deliver flowers by bike.","vi":"Phần đó để cháu lo. Mình cũng có thể giao hoa bằng xe đạp.","ipa":["aɪl","du","ðæt","pɑɹt","ənd","wi","kʊd","dɪˈlɪvɚ","ˈflaʊɚz","baɪ","baɪk"],"start":41.814,"end":45.034,"expression":"happy","timing":[[0,41.814],[1,41.948],[2,42.071],[3,42.279],[4,43.013],[5,43.405],[6,43.528],[7,43.663],[8,44.043],[9,44.472],[10,44.619]]},{"speaker":"ines","en":"Deliver? To whom?","vi":"Giao hoa á? Cho ai?","ipa":["dɪˈlɪvɚ","tu","hum"],"start":45.824,"end":47.884,"expression":"thinking","timing":[[0,45.824],[1,47.301],[2,47.453]]},{"speaker":"lena","en":"Old people in the area. They can't always come to the shop.","vi":"Người già trong khu ạ. Họ không phải lúc nào cũng đến tiệm được.","ipa":["oʊld","ˈpipəl","ɪn","ðə","ˈɛɹiə","ðeɪ","kænt","ˈɔlˌweɪz","kʌm","tu","ðə","ʃɑp"],"start":48.674,"end":51.734,"gesture":"explain","timing":[[0,48.674],[1,48.929],[2,49.322],[3,49.42],[4,49.493],[5,50.313],[6,50.497],[7,50.791],[8,51.098],[9,51.281],[10,51.355],[11,51.453]]},{"speaker":"ines","en":"That's a good idea. Mrs. Brown can't walk far anymore.","vi":"Ý hay đấy. Bà Brown giờ không đi xa được nữa.","ipa":["ðæts","ə","ɡʊd","aɪˈdiə","ˈmɪsɪz","bɹaʊn","kænt","wɔk","fɑɹ","ˌɛniˈmɔɹ"],"start":52.524,"end":56.924,"expression":"happy","gesture":"nod","timing":[[0,52.524],[1,52.741],[2,52.838],[3,53.033],[4,54.566],[5,55.025],[6,55.413],[7,55.719],[8,56.052],[9,56.386]]},{"speaker":"lena","en":"So… how about we try for three months?","vi":"Vậy… mình thử ba tháng xem sao ạ?","ipa":["soʊ","haʊ","əˈbaʊt","wi","tɹaɪ","fɔɹ","θɹi","mʌnθs"],"start":57.714,"end":60.084,"expression":"thinking","thoughtBubble":"calendar:3","timing":[[0,57.714],[1,58.511],[2,58.633],[3,58.878],[4,59.001],[5,59.271],[6,59.405],[7,59.626]]},{"speaker":"ines","en":"Three months. OK. If it fails, I'll pay the rent with your photos!","vi":"Ba tháng. Được. Nếu thất bại, bà sẽ trả tiền thuê nhà bằng ảnh của cháu!","ipa":["θɹi","mʌnθs","oʊˈkeɪ","ɪf","ɪt","feɪlz","aɪl","peɪ","ðə","ɹɛnt","wɪð","jɔɹ","ˈfoʊˌtoʊz"],"start":60.874,"end":67.284,"expression":"happy","react":{"lena":"happy"},"timing":[[0,60.874],[1,61.103],[2,62.664],[3,64.247],[4,64.442],[5,64.581],[6,65.47],[7,65.622],[8,65.845],[9,65.983],[10,66.275],[11,66.414],[12,66.553]]}],"words":[{"id":"customer","en":"customer","ipa":"ˈkʌstəmɚ","vi":"khách hàng","level":1},{"id":"offer","en":"offer","ipa":"ˈɔfɚ","vi":"đề nghị; lời mời; cung cấp","level":1},{"id":"knowledge","en":"knowledge","ipa":"ˈnɑlədʒ","vi":"kiến thức; hiểu biết; tri thức","level":1},{"id":"deliver","en":"deliver","ipa":"dɪˈlɪvɚ","vi":"giao hàng; phát biểu; đỡ đẻ; thực hiện lời hứa","level":2},{"id":"rent","en":"rent","ipa":"ɹɛnt","vi":"tiền thuê; thuê, cho thuê","level":1},{"id":"idea","en":"idea","ipa":"aɪˈdiə","vi":"ý tưởng; ý kiến; ý niệm","level":0}],"focus":{"title":"Đưa ra và đón nhận ý tưởng","pattern":"How about + V-ing / danh từ? · What if we…? · We could… · That's a good idea, but… · I'm not sure.","explain":"Gợi ý: \"How about a workshop?\", \"What if we deliver…?\", \"We could…\". Phản hồi: \"That's a good idea!\" hoặc ngần ngại \"I'm not sure…\", \"That's a good idea, but…\".","keys":["how about","what if","we could","that's a good idea","i'm not sure"],"lines":[5,6,8,9,11,14,15]},"audio":{"src":"/audio/library/videos/vd-a2-the-little-flower-shop.mp3","v":"87ea9522bd","duration":68.3